##grflangid 0x01
STR_GRF_AIR_NAME        :OpenTTD-Max Aviation
STR_GRF_AIR_DESC        :High-resolution (32bpp, up to 4x zoom) airliners and freighters: Concorde, Airbus and Boeing. {}Part of the OpenTTD-Max project.
STR_GRF_RAIL_NAME       :OpenTTD-Max High-Speed Rail
STR_GRF_RAIL_DESC       :High-resolution (32bpp, up to 4x zoom) Shinkansen and maglev trains. {}Part of the OpenTTD-Max project.
STR_GRF_URL             :https://github.com/lionkid/OpenTTD-Max

STR_BADGE_MANUFACTURER  :Manufacturer
STR_BADGE_BOEING        :Boeing
STR_BADGE_AIRBUS        :Airbus
STR_BADGE_AEROSPATIALE  :Aerospatiale/BAC
STR_BADGE_JR            :JR Group
STR_BADGE_TRANSRAPID    :Transrapid
STR_BADGE_CRRC          :CRRC
STR_BADGE_HSST          :HSST
STR_BADGE_ROLE          :Role
STR_BADGE_PASSENGER     :Passenger
STR_BADGE_FREIGHTER     :Freighter
STR_BADGE_SUPERSONIC    :Supersonic
STR_BADGE_KIND          :Type
STR_BADGE_SHINKANSEN    :Shinkansen
STR_BADGE_MAGLEV        :Maglev

STR_PARAM_DISABLE_AIRCRAFT_NAME :Disable original aircraft
STR_PARAM_DISABLE_AIRCRAFT_DESC :Hide the original aircraft so that only OpenTTD-Max aircraft are on sale. Existing original aircraft keep running.
STR_PARAM_DISABLE_MAGLEV_NAME   :Disable original maglev locomotives
STR_PARAM_DISABLE_MAGLEV_DESC   :Hide the original maglev locomotives (Lev1-Lev4, Wizzowow Rocketeer). Maglev wagons stay available.

STR_PARAM_LOADING_NAME          :Loading speed
STR_PARAM_LOADING_DESC          :Cargo loaded or unloaded per loading step by the vehicles of this set (aircraft: one step every 20 ticks, trains: every 40 ticks; a day is 74 ticks). Standard: a full load in 8 steps. Fast: 4 steps. Very fast: 2 steps. Original: a fixed 20 units (aircraft) or 5 units per car (trains) per step like the original vehicles, which is slow for large aircraft. Used only while gradual loading is on.
STR_PARAM_LOADING_STANDARD      :Standard (full load in 8 steps)
STR_PARAM_LOADING_FAST          :Fast (4 steps)
STR_PARAM_LOADING_VERY_FAST     :Very fast (2 steps)
STR_PARAM_LOADING_ORIGINAL      :Original (fixed units per step)
STR_PARAM_SOUNDS_NAME           :Sound effects
STR_PARAM_SOUNDS_DESC           :This set's own sounds (jet and Concorde takeoff, touchdown, Shinkansen and maglev departure) or the original game sounds.
STR_PARAM_SOUNDS_SET            :OpenTTD-Max sounds
STR_PARAM_SOUNDS_ORIGINAL       :Original game sounds

STR_PARAM_FORMATION_NAME        :Formations
STR_PARAM_FORMATION_DESC        :Fixed formations are bought as one complete train. Free formations: buy the two head cars (one dual-headed engine) and couple any number of that series' intermediate cars between them. Changing this in a running game removes the trains of the kind that is switched off.
STR_PARAM_FORMATION_BOTH        :Fixed and free formations
STR_PARAM_FORMATION_FIXED       :Fixed formations only
STR_PARAM_FORMATION_FREE        :Free formations only (head cars + intermediate cars)
